{"seq":2,"slug":"world-regions","title":"高二地理 — 世界区域","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/regional-development/world-regions","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高二地理-世界区域\">高二地理 — 世界区域</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>世界区域地理以大洲和主要国家为研究单元，从自然环境、资源分布、经济发展、人文特征等维度进行综合分析。高中阶段需要重点掌握的区域包括东亚、东南亚、南亚、中亚、西亚与北非、撒哈拉以南非洲、欧洲、北美、拉丁美洲、大洋洲和两极地区。每个区域都有其独特的地理特征和发展议题。</p>\n<p>世界主要区域对比概览：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>区域</th>\n<th>面积/万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>人口/亿</th>\n<th>气候特征</th>\n<th>核心发展议题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>东亚</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>季风气候为主</td>\n<td>经济一体化、老龄化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>东南亚</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>450</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 450</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">450</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>热带季风/雨林</td>\n<td>制造业转移、灾害频发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>南亚</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>热带季风</td>\n<td>人口压力、水资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>西亚北非</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>热带沙漠</td>\n<td>石油经济、水资源稀缺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧洲西部</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>温带海洋/地中海</td>\n<td>一体化深化、能源转型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>北美</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>2400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 2400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2400</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多样</td>\n<td>科技创新、移民</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-东亚与东南亚\">一、东亚与东南亚</h3><p><strong>东亚</strong>涵盖中国、日本、韩国、朝鲜和蒙古。该区域受季风环流控制，夏季高温多雨、冬季寒冷干燥。日本是典型的岛国经济体，资源匮乏但技术先进，工业布局高度集中在太平洋沿岸（太平洋工业带）。韩国通过&quot;汉江奇迹&quot;实现了快速工业化，半导体、汽车、造船业在全球占据重要地位。</p>\n<p><strong>东南亚</strong>地处亚洲与大洋洲、太平洋与印度洋的&quot;十字路口&quot;，战略位置极为重要。马六甲海峡是全球最繁忙的航运通道之一，每年约有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 万艘船只通过。东南亚是全球天然橡胶、棕榈油、锡矿的主要产地。近年来越南、印度尼西亚等国承接了大量从中国转移的劳动密集型产业。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-南亚与中亚\">二、南亚与中亚</h3><p><strong>南亚</strong>以印度为核心。印度次大陆的地理结构清晰：北部为喜马拉雅山脉、中部为恒河-印度河平原、南部为德干高原。南亚季风的强弱和来临时间直接决定农业丰歉——西南季风带来的降水占印度全年降水的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span> 以上。</p>\n<p>印度的人口已超越中国成为世界第一人口大国（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 亿），人口结构年轻（中位年龄约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span> 岁），享有&quot;人口红利&quot;优势。但种姓制度、宗教矛盾、基础设施不足等问题仍制约发展。</p>\n<p><strong>中亚</strong>五国（哈萨克斯坦、乌兹别克斯坦等）地处欧亚大陆腹地，气候干旱，以畜牧业和矿产开发为主。咸海萎缩是全球最严重的生态灾难之一——由于大规模灌溉棉花，注入咸海的阿姆河和锡尔河水量锐减，咸海面积从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.8</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 缩减到不足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-西亚北非与撒哈拉以南非洲\">三、西亚北非与撒哈拉以南非洲</h3><p><strong>西亚北非</strong>是全球石油储量最丰富的地区。波斯湾沿岸的沙特阿拉伯、伊拉克、伊朗、科威特、阿联酋等国控制着全球已探明石油储量的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">48\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48%</span></span></span></span></span>。石油收入支撑了海湾国家的现代化建设，但&quot;荷兰病&quot;效应明显——过度依赖资源出口导致产业结构单一。</p>\n<p>该区域水资源极度匮乏。以色列通过海水淡化、滴灌技术在干旱环境中发展出高效农业，成为&quot;沙漠农业奇迹&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>撒哈拉以南非洲</strong>是全球经济发展水平最低的区域。面临的核心问题包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粮食安全</td>\n<td>农业技术落后，干旱频发，约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 亿人长期处于饥饿状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疾病负担</td>\n<td>HIV/AIDS、疟疾、结核发病率全球最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政治不稳定</td>\n<td>部族冲突、政变频发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外债沉重</td>\n<td>殖民遗产与不公平贸易导致债务循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>但该区域也拥有显著潜力：丰富的矿产资源（钻石、黄金、钴、铂族金属）、年轻的人口结构、快速增长的移动互联网用户。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-欧洲\">四、欧洲</h3><p><strong>西欧</strong>是工业革命的发源地，当前以高度发达的服务业经济为主。欧盟是全球最大的区域经济一体化组织，实现了商品、服务、资本和人员的自由流动。</p>\n<p>欧洲的自然地理特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>地形以平原为主（西欧平原、东欧平原），有利于农业和交通</li>\n<li>温带海洋性气候（西部）→温带大陆性气候（东部），降水由西向东递减</li>\n<li>河流水量稳定、航运价值高（莱茵河、多瑙河）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>北欧</strong>以高福利社会模式著称，同时在清洁能源（挪威水电、丹麦风电）、信息技术（瑞典爱立信、芬兰诺基亚）领域领先全球。</p>\n<p><strong>东欧与俄罗斯</strong>：俄罗斯是世界上面积最大的国家（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1707</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1707</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1707</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），横跨欧亚两大洲。其经济高度依赖能源出口（石油、天然气），工业以军工和重化工为主。西伯利亚拥有全球最大的针叶林带（泰加林），面积超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-北美与拉丁美洲\">五、北美与拉丁美洲</h3><p><strong>北美</strong>（美国和加拿大）经济高度发达。美国的农业呈现鲜明的区域专业化特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>农业带</th>\n<th>分布</th>\n<th>主要作物/产品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>玉米带</td>\n<td>中北部（爱荷华、伊利诺伊）</td>\n<td>玉米、大豆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小麦带</td>\n<td>大平原（堪萨斯、北达科他）</td>\n<td>冬小麦、春小麦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>棉花带</td>\n<td>南部（德克萨斯、密西西比）</td>\n<td>棉花</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乳畜带</td>\n<td>东北部和五大湖</td>\n<td>乳制品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>拉丁美洲</strong>幅员辽阔，自然资源极为丰富。亚马孙热带雨林是全球最大的热带雨林，面积约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>550</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">550</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">550</span></span></span></span></span> 万 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{km}^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，被称为&quot;地球之肺&quot;。巴西是全球最大的咖啡、甘蔗和大豆生产国。但拉美许多国家深陷&quot;中等收入陷阱&quot;，贫富差距、城市化过度（过度城市化率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>）和生态破坏是突出问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-大洋洲与两极地区\">六、大洋洲与两极地区</h3><p><strong>澳大利亚</strong>被称为&quot;骑在羊背上的国家&quot;和&quot;坐在矿车上的国家&quot;。畜牧业和矿业是支柱产业。澳大利亚是全球最大的铁矿石和铝土矿出口国。人口和城市高度集中在东南沿海。</p>\n<p><strong>南极洲</strong>是全球最后一块未被开发的大陆，年平均气温 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-25°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">25°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，冰盖平均厚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2000</mn><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2000\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上。南极冰盖储存了全球 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 的淡水。《南极条约》规定南极只用于和平与科学研究目的。</p>\n<p><strong>北极地区</strong>因气候变暖而成为地缘政治焦点——北极航道的开通将大幅缩短亚欧航运距离，北极海底蕴藏丰富的油气资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在世界地图上标注马六甲海峡、苏伊士运河和巴拿马运河的位置，分析它们各自的航运战略意义。</li>\n<li>对比日本和澳大利亚的经济结构差异，并解释其地理成因。</li>\n<li>分析撒哈拉以南非洲粮食安全问题的自然原因与社会经济原因。</li>\n<li>为什么巴西城市化率超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>85</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">85\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">85%</span></span></span></span></span> 却被视为&quot;过度城市化&quot;？这与发达国家的高城市化率有何不同？</li>\n<li>综合分析北极地区在地缘政治、资源开发和生态保护三方面面临的机遇与挑战。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>联合国粮农组织（FAO）定期发布全球粮食安全报告，关注非洲和南亚的粮食危机数据。</li>\n<li>《经济学人》杂志的国家概况系列（Country Profiles）提供了各国政治、经济和社会的简明分析。</li>\n<li>关注&quot;一带一路&quot;倡议对中亚、东南亚、非洲等区域发展格局的深远影响。</li>\n<li>北极理事会（Arctic Council）的官方文件反映了北极治理的最新动态和各国博弈。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>世界区域地理的学习遵循&quot;定位→特征→成因→问题→对策&quot;的分析路径。每个区域都有其独特的自然环境基底和社会经济发展轨迹，关键在于把握区域特征的核心主线——东南亚的&quot;十字路口&quot;区位、西亚北非的石油与水资源矛盾、撒哈拉以南非洲的发展困境、欧洲的一体化模式、北美的农业专业化等。通过区域间的比较分析，能够深化对全球地理格局的整体理解。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高二地理 — 世界区域","id":"高二地理-世界区域"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、东亚与东南亚","id":"一-东亚与东南亚"},{"level":3,"text":"二、南亚与中亚","id":"二-南亚与中亚"},{"level":3,"text":"三、西亚北非与撒哈拉以南非洲","id":"三-西亚北非与撒哈拉以南非洲"},{"level":3,"text":"四、欧洲","id":"四-欧洲"},{"level":3,"text":"五、北美与拉丁美洲","id":"五-北美与拉丁美洲"},{"level":3,"text":"六、大洋洲与两极地区","id":"六-大洋洲与两极地区"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高二地理 — 中国区域","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/regional-development/china-regions"},"next":{"title":"高二地理 — 区域规划","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-2/geography/regional-development/regional-planning"}}